sign_in.text:
Your sign-in code is {code}

Type it on the sign-in page within {minutes} minutes. It works once.

If you did not ask for it, you can ignore this message; nobody can sign in without the code.

confirm.text:
Your code is {code}

Type it on the page that asked within {minutes} minutes, to sign in with this address when your passkey is not on the device you are using. It works once.

If you did not ask for it, you can ignore this message.
